OL,3,CThree firefighters killed in Greece as
OL,4,Cwildfires rage across southern Europe
OL,6,FThree firefighters have died in Greece
OL,7,Fas crews across southern Europe
OL,8,Fcontinue to fight unprecedented
OL,9,Fwildfires.
OL,11,FThe fires in parts of France, Spain
OL,12,Fand Greece have scorched hundreds of
OL,13,Fthousands of acres and, at their peak,
OL,14,Fdriven a third of a million people
OL,15,Ffrom their homes and holiday sites.
OL,17,FTwo firefighters died on Wednesday
OL,18,Fwhile battling a wildfire in the
OL,19,FRethymno region of Crete, Greece's
OL,20,Ffire department said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/8
