OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785457112
OL,3,CThree firefighters killed in Greece as
OL,4,Cwildfires rage across southern Europe
OL,6,FThey were among about 125 firefighters
OL,7,Fconfronting flames fanned by strong
OL,8,Fwinds.
OL,10,FThe department said they died "in the
OL,11,Fline of duty to protect the lives and
OL,12,Fproperty of citizens and the natural
OL,13,Fenvironment."
OL,15,FA third firefighter also died on
OL,16,FWednesday outside the fire perimeter,
OL,17,Fafter tackling a separate blaze in
OL,18,FGreece's southern Peloponnese region.
