OL,3,CThree firefighters killed in Greece as
OL,4,Cwildfires rage across southern Europe
OL,6,FHigher humidity, cooler temperatures
OL,7,Fand forecasts for rain have raised
OL,8,Fhopes of relief for France's Gironde
OL,9,Fregion, where wildfires have scorched
OL,10,Fan area four times the size of Paris
OL,11,Fin recent weeks.
OL,13,FNational weather service Meteo-France
OL,14,Fforecast light rain in the town of
OL,15,FLege-Cap-Ferret, on the peninsula that
OL,16,Fhas been at the forefront of the
OL,17,Fdevastated area.
OL,26,@uD@[rruD@]rrwD@Bqr
