OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785457112
OL,3,CThree firefighters killed in Greece as
OL,4,Cwildfires rage across southern Europe
OL,6,FLocal officials reported a "rather
OL,7,Fcalm" night, with the fire not
OL,8,Fspreading beyond the 42,000 hectares
OL,9,F(around 162 sq miles) already affected.
OL,11,FFire crews remained on "total
OL,12,Fmobilisation", with 2,200 firefighters
OL,13,Fand more than 20 aircraft deployed.
OL,15,FThe Gironde wildfire forced 220,000
OL,16,Fpeople to evacuate at the height of
OL,17,Fthe crisis. Tens of thousands have
OL,18,Fsince been allowed to return home, but
OL,19,Fauthorities warned the danger had not
OL,20,Fyet passed.
OL,26,@nD@\OUoD@EO]sD@XOUtD@MO]
