OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785457112
OL,3,CThree firefighters killed in Greece as
OL,4,Cwildfires rage across southern Europe
OL,6,FExtreme heat strips moisture from
OL,7,Fvegetation and drives down humidity,
OL,8,Fturning grasses, brush and forest
OL,9,Flitter into faster-burning fuel.
OL,11,FInvestigators believe contractors
OL,12,Fworking near a high-voltage line for
OL,13,Fpower-grid operator Enedis ignited the
OL,14,Fblaze while using a brush-cutting
OL,15,Fmachine, Bordeaux prosecutor Renaud
OL,16,FGaudeul said.
OL,18,FAt the height of the crisis, roughly
OL,19,F330,000 people were evacuated across
OL,20,FFrance and Spain.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/8
