OL,3,CThree firefighters killed in Greece as
OL,4,Cwildfires rage across southern Europe
OL,6,FTens of thousands of people began
OL,7,Freturning home in central Spain after
OL,8,Ffirefighters made progress around
OL,9,FMadrid and Avila.
OL,11,FEvacuation orders were lifted for
OL,12,Fabout 20,000 people in the Madrid
OL,13,Fregion, while stay-at-home
OL,14,Frestrictions ended for another 14,000.
