OL,3,CThree firefighters killed in Greece as
OL,4,Cwildfires rage across southern Europe
OL,6,FBut 10,000 people remain under
OL,7,Fevacuation orders in Castellon, where
OL,8,Fa fire was still out of control as
OL,9,FSpain braced for its fourth heat wave
OL,10,Fof the summer.
OL,12,FMore than 448 square miles (1,160
OL,13,Fsquare kilometres) have burned across
OL,14,FFrance this year, according to the
OL,15,FInterior Ministry.
OL,17,FEurope is the world's fastest-warming
OL,18,Fcontinent, warming at more than twice
OL,19,Fthe global average, according to the
OL,20,FEuropean Union's Copernicus climate
OL,21,Fservice.
