OL,3,CThree firefighters killed in Greece as
OL,4,Cwildfires rage across southern Europe
OL,6,FWestern Europe recorded its hottest
OL,7,FJune on record, with extreme heat and
OL,8,Fwidespread dryness contributing to the
OL,9,Fspread and intensification of fires in
OL,10,FFrance and Spain.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/8
